# Allowlist: the build context is exactly what the Dockerfile COPYs, nothing
# else. Excluding everything first means a new secret file (.env.*, a token
# handoff file, a key) can never reach the builder by being forgotten here.
*

# Required by the Dockerfile.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!uv.lock
!app

# Never ship these, even from inside app/.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pem
**/*-key.json
**/credentials*.json
